{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "3f6c2e10-5a4b-4c2d-9e7a-1b2c3d4e5f60",
		"name": "SMF RESTful API",
		"description": "Collection for the SMF RESTful API mod (index.php?action=api).\n\nSet the collection variables `base_url` and `api_key` on the Variables tab. This collection is one end-to-end scenario: run it whole with Postman's Collection Runner (\"Run collection\") and it walks the full lifecycle in order - create category -> board -> topic -> reply, plus a throwaway member; inspects and edits each; then tears everything down child-first (post -> topic -> board -> category -> member).\n\nSAFETY: every editing/deleting request works only on data this run created. Each \"Create ...\" stores the new id into a collection variable (`category_id`, `board_id`, `member_id`, `topic_id`, `post_id`); Get/Update/Replace/Delete read that variable. The id variables start EMPTY and every mutating request has a pre-request guard that aborts the send if its id is still empty - so a delete can never hit a pre-existing forum item, even if a Create was skipped or failed. The api_key must belong to a member allowed to manage boards, moderate the forum and post.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "apikey",
		"apikey": [
			{ "key": "key", "value": "X-API-Key", "type": "string" },
			{ "key": "value", "value": "{{api_key}}", "type": "string" },
			{ "key": "in", "value": "header", "type": "string" }
		]
	},
	"event": [
		{
			"listen": "prerequest",
			"script": {
				"type": "text/javascript",
				"exec": [
					"// Unique letters-only suffix for names/emails, set fresh each request so",
					"// re-runs never collide. Letters (not digits) on purpose: the forum may run",
					"// the Username Validator mod, which restricts specific characters via",
					"// uv_restricted_symbols (here the digit 5). Avoiding digits sidesteps it.",
					"pm.collectionVariables.set('rand', Array.from({length: 12}, function () { return 'abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz'[Math.floor(Math.random() * 26)]; }).join(''));"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"listen": "test",
			"script": {
				"type": "text/javascript",
				"exec": [
					"pm.test('Valid API response', function () {",
					"    if (pm.response.code === 204) {",
					"        // 204 No Content is the correct reply to a successful DELETE:",
					"        // no body, and HTTP strips Content-Type since there is nothing to type.",
					"        pm.expect(pm.response.text() || '', '204 must have an empty body').to.equal('');",
					"    } else {",
					"        pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type') || '', 'expected a JSON body').to.include('application/json');",
					"    }",
					"});"
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"variable": [
		{ "key": "base_url", "value": "https://smf21.local", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "api_key", "value": "your-api-key-here", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "category_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "board_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "member_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
